{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39315","headline":"题汧阳县马跑泉李学士别业 · 韦庄","name":"题汧阳县马跑泉李学士别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水满寒塘菊满篱，篱边无限彩禽飞。\n西园夜雨红樱熟，南亩清风白稻肥。\n草色自留闲客住，泉声如待主人归。\n九霄岐路忙於火，肯恋斜阳守钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}